{"id":"n16110-2-7","stage":3,"title":"면 · 面","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16110-2-7-1","ko":"이것 봐. 친구한테 받은 선물이야.","zh":"看这个，是我朋友送给我的礼物。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"친구한테","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구한테","audio":"/audio/d3b5294e4e8555bc0bef.mp3"}},{"text":"받은","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받은","audio":"/audio/135720fd9fd0e73d4239.mp3"}},{"text":"선물이야.","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물이야","audio":"/audio/c50edb621ff503f15ccb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ea443c4028de4a3d927.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16110-2-7-2","ko":"와아! 각 면에 꽃무늬가 새겨진 예쁜 꽃병이구나.","zh":"哇！每个面上都刻有花纹的漂亮花瓶啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와아!","meaning":"哇","explanation":"와아：哇","readings":[{"term":"와아","audio":"/audio/51dc944eb402d4820d9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:와아:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"와아","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와아","audio":"/audio/51dc944eb402d4820d9a.mp3"}},{"text":"각","meaning":"各","explanation":"각：各","readings":[{"term":"각","audio":"/audio/45ec909f30174e6585c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29728","senseId":"1","lemma":"각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"각","audio":"/audio/45ec909f30174e6585c6.mp3"}},{"text":"면에","meaning":"面","explanation":"면：面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"면","audio":"/audio/cd4530df02c851d2b57a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16110","senseId":"2","lemma":"면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"면에","audio":"/audio/be3d88dd6d56dd913d63.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃무늬가","meaning":"花纹","explanation":"꽃무늬：花纹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"꽃무늬","audio":"/audio/b48618b67ff0eafd3d55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38232","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃무늬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃무늬가","audio":"/audio/e5683557ff86ce74590b.mp3"}},{"text":"새겨진","meaning":"刻；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"새기다：刻；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"새기다","audio":"/audio/2f6d84c40f417ada367b.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16228","senseId":"1","lemma":"새기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새겨진","audio":"/audio/94547915a0604b6176ce.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁜","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁜","audio":"/audio/f8f7dec8665f370f90bb.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃병이구나.","meaning":"花瓶","explanation":"꽃병：花瓶；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"꽃병","audio":"/audio/e02337ff0599809387f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38260","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃병이구나","audio":"/audio/d56e98b1f8f233449da3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"51dc944eb402d482","term":"와아","zh":"哇","audio":"/audio/51dc944eb402d4820d9a.mp3","definition":"表示惊讶、赞叹的感叹。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"45ec909f30174e65","term":"각","zh":"各","audio":"/audio/45ec909f30174e6585c6.mp3","entryId":"29728","definition":"把几个分成一个个后的单个的，单独一个的。","pronunciation":["각"]},{"id":"cd4530df02c851d2","term":"면","zh":"面","audio":"/audio/cd4530df02c851d2b57a.mp3","entryId":"16110","definition":"构成立体的平面或表面。","pronunciation":["면ː"]},{"id":"b48618b67ff0eafd","term":"꽃무늬","zh":"花纹","audio":"/audio/b48618b67ff0eafd3d55.mp3","entryId":"38232","definition":"花形状的纹路。","pronunciation":["꼰무니"]},{"id":"2f6d84c40f417ada","term":"새기다","zh":"刻","audio":"/audio/2f6d84c40f417ada367b.mp3","entryId":"16228","definition":"雕出画或字等。","pronunciation":["새기다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"e02337ff05998093","term":"꽃병","zh":"花瓶","audio":"/audio/e02337ff0599809387f4.mp3","entryId":"38260","definition":"插花用的瓶子。","pronunciation":["꼳뼝"]}],"audio":"/audio/e66130892151394760c7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.233,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16110","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9583,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看这个，是我朋友送给我的礼物。","哇！每个面上都刻有花纹的漂亮花瓶啊。","智秀好像很有钢琴天赋呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看这个，是我朋友送给我的礼物。","哇！每个面上都刻有花纹的漂亮花瓶啊。","智秀好像很有钢琴天赋呢。"],"answer":1}]}
